message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "voro-tree-qa: quality checks for public tree registers (Baumkataster)"
abstract: "Quality checks for the public tree register of the City of Zurich (81 142 trees, CC0), measured against the limits the city states for its own data. Every step is a prediction committed before the code and the run, then an outcome with a verdict per point. Version 0.1: reconnaissance of the public endpoints and the first measurement M0 (13 points, 11 confirmed, 2 refuted)."
type: software
